Full-width card (no columns) with 2-3 structured items. Each item has a short heading and one sentence. Items use colored fills tied to the palette. Good for: visual catalogs, data highlights on non-image cards.

## Positioning Vocabulary

- **Overlaid**: text on top of a full-bleed image
